  "updated_at": "2026-03-20",
  "bio": "Welcome to Black Atlas Studios, the illustrative inking haven nestled in the creative heart of Chicago's Bridgeport neighborhood. Under the deft hand of Jessica Beck, this studio transforms skin into a canvas for bold, story-rich artistry, where each tattoo is a unique journey mapped with precision and personal flair. Connect with us at beckjart@gmail.com to etch your narrative into timeless body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chicago, Illinois, United States"
}